{"audit_id":"math2.lilin880.first-three-chapters.20260821","chapter_id":"math2.calculus.ch03","source_section":"高数第二章｜综合解答","source_pdf_pages":[214],"item_ref":"ch02.comprehensive.solution.001","item_kind":"nonchoice","prompt":"分段函数 ax²+b sin x+c(x≤0)，ln(1+x)(x>0)，求一阶导连续而二阶导不存在的参数。","topic_tags":["导函数连续","分段函数"],"type_pool":"可导与连续","subquestions":[{"label":"主问","formal_answer":"a≠−1/2，b=1，c=0","official_analysis":"连续与一阶导连续给 c=0,b=1；左右二阶导为2a与−1。","independent_check":"二阶导不存在当且仅当2a≠−1。","status":"verified"}],"official_answer_source_pages":[62],"source_status":"题面文本层与答案视觉核验。","verification_status":"verified","reviewed_at":"2026-08-21T17:53:00+08:00","reviewed_by":"Codex"}
{"audit_id":"math2.lilin880.first-three-chapters.20260821","chapter_id":"math2.calculus.ch03","source_section":"高数第二章｜综合解答","source_pdf_pages":[215],"item_ref":"ch02.comprehensive.solution.002","item_kind":"nonchoice","prompt":"周期为5的连续 f，在1邻域给出 f(1+sin x)−3f(1−sin x)=8x+o(x)，且 f 在1可导，求 x=6 的切线。","topic_tags":["可导","周期函数"],"type_pool":"导数定义","subquestions":[{"label":"主问","formal_answer":"2x−y−12=0","official_analysis":"取 x→0 先得 f(1)=0；除以 sin x 得 f'(1)+3f'(1)=8；周期性给 f(6)=0,f'(6)=2。","independent_check":"切线 y=2(x−6)。","status":"verified"}],"official_answer_source_pages":[62],"source_status":"题面文本层与答案视觉核验。","verification_status":"verified","reviewed_at":"2026-08-21T17:53:00+08:00","reviewed_by":"Codex"}
{"audit_id":"math2.lilin880.first-three-chapters.20260821","chapter_id":"math2.calculus.ch03","source_section":"高数第二章｜综合解答","source_pdf_pages":[217],"item_ref":"ch02.comprehensive.solution.004","item_kind":"nonchoice","prompt":"f(x)=|x|^p sin(1/x)(x≠0),f(0)=0：分判0处连续、可导、导函数连续的 p。","topic_tags":["连续","可导","振荡函数"],"type_pool":"可导与连续","subquestions":[{"label":"(I)","formal_answer":"p>0","official_analysis":"|f(x)|≤|x|^p。","independent_check":"p≤0 时极限不存在。","status":"verified"},{"label":"(II)","formal_answer":"p>1","official_analysis":"差商为 |x|^(p−1)sin(1/x)（注意左右符号）。","independent_check":"p>1 时左右均趋0。","status":"verified"},{"label":"(III)","formal_answer":"p>2","official_analysis":"x≠0 处导数含 |x|^(p−2)cos(1/x) 项。","independent_check":"p>2 才保证 f'(x)→f'(0)=0。","status":"verified"}],"official_answer_source_pages":[63],"source_status":"题面文本层与答案视觉核验。","verification_status":"verified","reviewed_at":"2026-08-21T17:53:00+08:00","reviewed_by":"Codex"}
{"audit_id":"math2.lilin880.first-three-chapters.20260821","chapter_id":"math2.calculus.ch03","source_section":"高数第二章｜综合解答","source_pdf_pages":[222],"item_ref":"ch02.comprehensive.solution.009","item_kind":"nonchoice","prompt":"f 在(a,b)可导：由端点单侧导数判断 f' 的零点与介值性质。","topic_tags":["导数介值性","极值"],"type_pool":"导数定义","subquestions":[{"label":"(I)","formal_answer":"存在 ξ∈(a,b)，f'(ξ)=0","official_analysis":"端点一正一负时，最小值不能在两端，只能在内点。","independent_check":"内点极值导数为0。","status":"verified"},{"label":"(II)","formal_answer":"任意介于 f'_+(a)、f'_−(b) 的 μ 均可取到","official_analysis":"对 g(x)=f(x)−μx 用(I)。","independent_check":"得到 f'(ξ)=μ；体现导数的 Darboux 性质。","status":"verified"}],"official_answer_source_pages":[65],"source_status":"题面文本层与答案视觉核验。","verification_status":"verified","reviewed_at":"2026-08-21T17:53:00+08:00","reviewed_by":"Codex"}
{"audit_id":"math2.lilin880.first-three-chapters.20260821","chapter_id":"math2.calculus.ch03","source_section":"高数第二章｜综合解答","source_pdf_pages":[230],"item_ref":"ch02.comprehensive.solution.016","item_kind":"nonchoice","prompt":"f(x)=Σa_k sin(kx)：求 f'(0)；若 |f(x)|≤|sin x|，证明系数加权和界。","topic_tags":["导数定义","三角多项式"],"type_pool":"导数定义","subquestions":[{"label":"(I)","formal_answer":"f'(0)=a₁+2a₂+…+naₙ","official_analysis":"逐项求导后令 x=0。","independent_check":"有限和可直接换序。","status":"verified"},{"label":"(II)","formal_answer":"|a₁+2a₂+…+naₙ|≤1","official_analysis":"取导数定义并由 |f(x)|≤|sin x| 夹逼。","independent_check":"|f'(0)|≤lim |sin x|/|x|=1。","status":"verified"}],"official_answer_source_pages":[68],"source_status":"题面文本层与答案视觉核验。","verification_status":"verified","reviewed_at":"2026-08-21T17:53:00+08:00","reviewed_by":"Codex"}
{"audit_id":"math2.lilin880.first-three-chapters.20260821","chapter_id":"math2.calculus.ch03","source_section":"高数第二章｜综合解答","source_pdf_pages":[231],"item_ref":"ch02.comprehensive.solution.017","item_kind":"nonchoice","prompt":"f 可导，证明 y=f(x)（f>0）与 y=f(x)sin x 在交点处相切。","topic_tags":["切线","导数"],"type_pool":"微分","subquestions":[{"label":"主问","formal_answer":"两曲线在每个交点处相切","official_analysis":"交点由 f(x)>0 得 sin x=1，即 x=π/2+2kπ；此处 cos x=0。","independent_check":"[f sin x]'=f' sin x+f cos x=f'。","status":"verified"}],"official_answer_source_pages":[68],"source_status":"题面文本层与答案视觉核验。","verification_status":"verified","reviewed_at":"2026-08-21T17:53:00+08:00","reviewed_by":"Codex"}
{"audit_id":"math2.lilin880.first-three-chapters.20260821","chapter_id":"math2.calculus.ch03","source_section":"高数第二章｜综合解答","source_pdf_pages":[233],"item_ref":"ch02.comprehensive.solution.019","item_kind":"nonchoice","prompt":"f 二阶连续、f(0)=f'(0)=0,f''(0)>0；u(x) 为切线的 x 轴截距，求 lim x/u(x)。","topic_tags":["切线","洛必达"],"type_pool":"微分","subquestions":[{"label":"主问","formal_answer":"2","official_analysis":"u=x−f/f'；对 x/u 作洛必达并用 f'(0)=0、f''(0)>0。","independent_check":"极限=1+lim f'/(x f'')=2。","status":"verified"}],"official_answer_source_pages":[69],"source_status":"题面文本层与答案视觉核验。","verification_status":"verified","reviewed_at":"2026-08-21T17:53:00+08:00","reviewed_by":"Codex"}
